<p>Haaye haaye haaye, haaye husain..(2)<br> Guzri jo qatl gaah se, zainab jigar figaar<br> aakhe'n lahu lahu thi, badan par ghumo'n ka baar<br> laasho'n ko dekh dekh ke, roti thi zaar zaar<br> kehti thi jald aaiye, yaa shah e zulfiqaar<br> kaise batau kya mere, dil par guzar gai...<br> laashe pe bewatan ke jo, mai nange sar gai<br> haye baba...</p> 
<p>ghurbat me qatl hogaya mazloom bewatan<br> mai bhai bhai kehti thi, laasha behan behan..(3)</p> 
<p>1. Teero'n pe tha rakha hua, laasha husain ka<br> dooba hua lahu me, tha kurta husain ka<br> awaaz thi husain ki behna kafan kafan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>2. Aayi na raas do ghadi, pardes ki fiza<br> kunba shaheed hogaya, mera ghar ujad gaya<br> pardes des ghayr ka apna watan watan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>3. Ek dil pe daagh maine, bahattar utha liye<br> kuch daagh maine qalb ke, andar chhupa liye<br> chupte nahi chupaane se daaghe rasan rasan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>4. Dekha hai baba maine, jo manzar batau kya<br> naizo'n pe rakha hua, sar har shaheed ka<br> ghodo'n ke daudne se tha tukde badan badan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>5. Qasim ki laash laaye, the daman me shahe dee'n<br> sehre se beniyaz thi, naushaah ki jabee'n<br> ek shab ki rehne payi na jiski dulhan dulhan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>6. Barchi kaleja e ali, akbar me jab lagi<br> baba ko di sada kabhi, awaaz mujhko di<br> kehta tha seena thaam ke amma chubhan chubhan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>7. Baba hasan se taba, husain e shaheed tak<br> baba ameer e shaam se, daur e yazeed tak<br> loota hai ehle shaam ne baba chaman chaman<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>8. Ghazi ke baad aur, qayamat guzar gayi<br> pyaaso ki aas tootke, ban me bikhar gayi<br> ek shor al atashh ka bapa tha dahan dahan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>9. Ye naukri bhi khoob hai, rehan aur raza<br> bhai ki naukri ka, behen ne diya sila<br> Han wo behen ye nauha tha jiska sukhan sukhan<br> mai bhai bhai...</p> 
<p>Haye baba...</p>